OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FCloudy across Scotland and
OL,6,FNorthern Ireland with outbreaks of
OL,7,Fshowery rain, although some brighter
OL,8,Fspells are also possible. Elsewhere,
OL,9,Fit will be dry and sunny, with
OL,10,Ftemperatures rising quickly in the
OL,11,Fsoutheast, where it will feel very hot
OL,12,Fand humid.
OL,13,
OL,14,CTonight:FPatchy rain will sink south,
OL,15,Freaching northern England and Wales,
OL,16,Falthough any rain will mostly fade.
OL,17,FOtherwise, it will be dry with clear
OL,18,Fspells. A warm night in the south.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
