OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CThursday:FA band of thicker cloud will
OL,6,Fcontinue to sink south on Thursday,
OL,7,Fintroducing fresher conditions for
OL,8,Fall. However, outbreaks of rain,
OL,9,Flocally heavy at times, will affect
OL,10,Fnorthern Scotland.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
